    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Team up with friends to survive and upgrade your abilities in a world filled with various equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713960/extras/2c3e2a9fbde6b3567a24cb55434879fb.avif?t=1729430838\" width=616 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming:</strong> Grow a wide variety of plants and raise animals to build and expand your farm.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713960/extras/3b673c794330898ecc9507b784f9c43b.avif?t=1729430838\" width=616 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival:</strong> Gather resources, craft tools, and fight to survive against harsh environments and challenging enemies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713960/extras/f29630bca3d866a57dd9683e403f4fe8.avif?t=1729430838\" width=616 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Te-Amic:</strong> A special system where you can make new friends to assist you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713960/extras/77b9c6f463b293caf7e8602dddb27908.avif?t=1729430838\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Team up with friends to survive and upgrade your abilities in a world filled with various equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713960/extras/2c3e2a9fbde6b3567a24cb55434879fb.avif?t=1729430838\" width=616 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming:</strong> Grow a wide variety of plants and raise animals to build and expand your farm.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713960/extras/3b673c794330898ecc9507b784f9c43b.avif?t=1729430838\" width=616 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival:</strong> Gather resources, craft tools, and fight to survive against harsh environments and challenging enemies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713960/extras/f29630bca3d866a57dd9683e403f4fe8.avif?t=1729430838\" width=616 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Te-Amic:</strong> A special system where you can make new friends to assist you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713960/extras/77b9c6f463b293caf7e8602dddb27908.avif?t=1729430838\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p></li></ul>",
